  "description": "Ho-Rang, a pretty fox spirit, loses his fox pearl and gets kidnapped. Lee Ju-Hwa, a wolf hybrid, appears in front of him with overflowing Yang energy. If Ho-Rang seduces and drains the overflowing Yang energy out of Ju-Hwa, he would be able to retrieve his fox pearl more quickly! Can Ho-Rang safely do it and return to his hometown?\n\n(Source: BOMTOON, translated)",
